WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:02.660
The Bear and the Bee

2
00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:08.240
(A version of the tale by TheFableCottage.com)

3
00:00:10.390 --> 00:00:13.910
Everybody knows that bears love honey.

4
00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:21.250
One day Mr Bear looks in his cupboard  and he can't find any honey.

5
00:00:22.310 --> 00:00:26.780
"Oh no! No honey!" he says.

6
00:00:27.190 --> 00:00:30.510
So he goes into the forest to find some.

7
00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:36.240
He sees a beehive in a tree.

8
00:00:36.830 --> 00:00:38.830
He smells the honey.

9
00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:41.730
"Mmmmm! Honey!"

10
00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:45.880
He sticks his paw into the beehive and…

11
00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:47.960
ZZZZZZZZZ!

12
00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:49.960
A bee flies out.

13
00:00:50.790 --> 00:00:54.320
“Hey, bear! Go away!” says the bee.

14
00:00:54.630 --> 00:00:56.840
"This is not your honey!"

15
00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:59.500
Mr Bear is annoyed.

16
00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:03.430
“I am bigger than you,” he says.

17
00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:06.480
“And I am stronger than you too.

18
00:01:06.590 --> 00:01:08.590
I can do what I want!

19
00:01:08.590 --> 00:01:10.180
Now... buzz off!”

20
00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:15.040
Mr Bear sticks his paw into the beehive again and…

21
00:01:15.040 --> 00:01:18.700
ZZZZZZZZZ!  ZING!

22
00:01:18.850 --> 00:01:19.910
OWIE!

23
00:01:20.320 --> 00:01:23.620
The bee stings him right on his nose!

24
00:01:24.430 --> 00:01:26.950
“My nose! My nose!

25
00:01:26.950 --> 00:01:31.660
Oooh... I'm so angry!" growls Mr Bear.

26
00:01:32.160 --> 00:01:34.910
He finds a big stick.

27
00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:37.400
He tries to hit the bee.

28
00:01:37.900 --> 00:01:42.410
He swings and he swings,  but the bee is too fast!

29
00:01:42.890 --> 00:01:46.470
Mr Bear gets angrier and angrier.

30
00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:52.380
"GARRRRRGHH! I WILL SQUASH YOU!  COME HERE!"

31
00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:55.220
The bee flies back into the beehive.

32
00:01:56.080 --> 00:02:00.620
"AH HAH! Now you're trapped!" yells Mr Bear.

33
00:02:01.050 --> 00:02:03.900
He swings his stick at the beehive.

34
00:02:03.900 --> 00:02:06.590
Smash! Smash! Smash!

35
00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:09.240
He smashes it to pieces!

36
00:02:10.220 --> 00:02:12.760
Then he hears a strange sound.

37
00:02:13.160 --> 00:02:16.290
It gets louder and louder…

38
00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:23.270
ZZZZ! ZZZZ! ZZZ! Zzzz!  ZZZZZZZZZZ! Zzzz! ZZZZ!

39
00:02:23.270 --> 00:02:27.200
Thousands of bees fly out  of the smashed beehive.

40
00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:30.230
They fly around Mr Bear's head…

41
00:02:30.470 --> 00:02:35.730
ZZZZZZZZZ… ZING!  They sting him on his ear.

42
00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:40.090
ZING ZING!  They sting him on his elbow.

43
00:02:40.390 --> 00:02:43.220
They chase Mr Bear through the forest.

44
00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:47.680
They sting him on his arms,  his legs, his hands...

45
00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:50.350
... and especially on his nose.

46
00:02:50.340 --> 00:02:51.980
ZING! ZING! ZING!

47
00:02:52.340 --> 00:02:58.110
Mr Bear runs all the way home  and slams the door shut. BAM!

48
00:02:59.790 --> 00:03:02.410
Then he hears a voice behind him.

49
00:03:02.890 --> 00:03:04.530
It’s Mrs. Bear.

50
00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:08.340
“You did it again, didn’t you?” she says.

51
00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:10.390
“You lost your temper.”

52
00:03:10.860 --> 00:03:16.620
“Yes,” he says as he cries  and counts his bee stings.

53
00:03:17.620 --> 00:03:21.260
“Here’s the bee-sting medicine,”  says Mrs. Bear.

54
00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:24.050
“Also, we have honey in the cupboard.

55
00:03:24.050 --> 00:03:26.050
It’s behind the flour.”

56
00:03:28.570 --> 00:03:33.590
Moral: A hot temper always  gets you into trouble.
